{"ID":"20240118151135-qpgeewb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151135-qpgeewb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151135-qpgeewb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151135-2mvtylz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130301-jnjqkq5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130301-jnjqkq5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:183,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:183\u0026#125;","title":"185[gǎo]槀本","type":"doc","updated":"20240201101621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151135-2mvtylz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151135-2mvtylz","updated":"20240201101508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名地新。味辛，温，无毒。治妇人疝瘕，阴中寒肿痛，腹中急，除风头痛，长肌肤，悦颜色。生山谷。名鬼卿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130244-cq6iqe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130244-cq6iqe3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】野生草本。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130246-c0a9poe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130246-c0a9poe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性温。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130247-j0ivh7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130247-j0ivh7i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】鬼卿为祛风寒镇痛要药，治大寒犯脑头痛齿亦痛，女人阴寒肿痛，体肤风湿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130249-bvsw8bx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130249-bvsw8bx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】头面身体皮肤风湿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130250-jjq2txa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130250-jjq2txa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治皮肤疵皯，酒皻，粉刺，癫疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130252-jzbol3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130252-jzbol3l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】治太阳头痛，巅顶痛，大寒犯脑，痛连齿颊。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130253-1y32u2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130253-1y32u2b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130254-0vdlts9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130254-0vdlts9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】热病头痛，血虚头痛，均忌服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130256-aioidnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130256-aioidnf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】头屑干洗—槀本，白芷等份共末，夜擦旦梳，垢自去。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130242-1wxe7bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130242-1wxe7bp"}},{"ID":"20240122130256-41nv890","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130256-41nv890"}},{"ID":"20240122130257-bwvp1kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130257-bwvp1kp","updated":"20240201101537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第22第一百八十五，诸位看这个槀本，它又有一个名称叫做鬼卿。那这个药呢，在皮肤病上面，我们为了让女子美容养颜，使用得很多。还有呢，它之劳妇人的疝气、徵瘕，阴中寒，阴部那边的寒痛，妇科上用得很多。这个味苦味、辛味，槀字原来是“藁”这样子，在本草经上面就变成这样子写的，原来那个正楷字，这个古体字，查这个字就查到了，槀本。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130301-jnjqkq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130301-jnjqkq5","updated":"20240201101621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它主要的功能呢，因为它是苦味的，辛味的，所以苦味能够泄，辛味能够散，所以能够驱风、祛风寒，能够镇痛。那头痛啊、牙齿痛啊、女人的阴部痛啊。使用的时机，我们常常用在脸上的，不管是脸上的斑，红斑哪，还有些黑，雀斑啊，一些条啊，还有酒糟鼻啊都可以使用，那这个复方，你有头屑，老师头皮太多了，你用槀本跟那个白芷混在一起用，都是一般性的经验方，诸位可以看看，可以使用没有关系。"}]}]}